# Astro-with-pnpm compat: renderer packages (@astrojs/react, etc.) must
# be resolvable from Astro's internal `@astro-renderers` module, which
# lives under Astro's own node_modules. With pnpm's isolated layout,
# that only works if these packages are public-hoisted.
#
# See https://docs.astro.build/en/install-and-setup/#configure-pnpm
public-hoist-pattern[]=*astro*
public-hoist-pattern[]=@astrojs/*
